<title>SINGAPORE: Vickers Ballas gets Singapore OHQ status.</title>
<headline>Vickers Ballas gets Singapore OHQ status.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vickers Ballas Holdings Ltd said it had been awarded Operational Headquarters Incentive status by the Monetary Authority of Singapore.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement received by Reuters on Thursday the status entitled it to a concessionary tax rate of 10 percent on its net income for a initial period of five years.</p>
<p>Singapore's normal corporate tax rate is currently 26 percent.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
